{"timestamp": 1779402479.005058, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 12, "data": {"caller": "player_2", "reason": "Charlie reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Frank"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779402479.005655, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 12, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779402490.2649221, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I found Frank dead in Medbay. My route this round was Navigation, then Security, then Electrical, and finally Medbay where I spotted the body. \n\nWhile I was in Security early on, I saw Alice come in from Electrical and then head up towards Weapons, so she was nowhere near Medbay at that time. \n\nDid anyone see someone leaving Medbay or hanging around the left side of the map? Let's hear where everyone was."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402499.815209, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started up in Oxygen, then made my way down through Upper Engine and Lower Engine, and I had just arrived in Storage when this meeting was called. I haven't seen a single person this entire round. \n\nSince I was covering the left side of the map and didn't cross paths with anyone, whoever killed Frank probably entered Medbay from Cafeteria, Electrical, or maybe passed through Storage before I got there. Charlie, thanks for the info on Alice. Let's hear what the rest of you were doing and see if we can piece together who was near the middle."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402520.779006, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I started in Cafeteria, went down through Medbay, into Storage, and I was just doing my Fuel Engines task in Lower Engine when the meeting was called. \n\nThe important thing is that when I passed through Medbay earlier, I didn't see Frank or a body. That means Frank must have walked in and gotten killed *after* I headed down to Storage. Like Bob, I haven't seen a single person this entire round. \n\nIf Bob was on the left side and Charlie came from the right, we really need to hear from Eve and Alice. Eve, where were you? Did you see Frank heading toward Medbay?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779402547.715035, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Thanks Diana. Okay, my route this round: I started in Storage, then headed up through Medbay, into Cafeteria, and ended up in Weapons when the meeting was called.\n\nHere's the thing \u2014 when I passed through Medbay, it was empty. No Frank, no body, nothing. So I was through there before the kill happened, which lines up with Diana's account since she came through Medbay earlier too. That means Frank walked into Medbay *after* both Diana and I had already left.\n\nI also want to flag something: I did briefly see Frank back in Storage early on \u2014 he came in from Lower Engine. After that I lost track of him. So Frank was alive and moving through the bottom of the map early, then ended up dead in Medbay later.\n\nThat timing is interesting. Bob says he went Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine \u2192 Storage, but I was in Storage early and didn't see Bob there. And Charlie \u2014 you said you came from Electrical into Medbay and found the body. Electrical connects right to Medbay. I'm not accusing yet, but I'd really like to hear Alice's route before I lock in a vote. Alice, you're up \u2014 where were you?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779402647.2426822, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Charlie, I can 100% vouch for you. My route was Electrical, then Security, then up to Weapons, and back to Security. I saw you in Security early on coming from Navigation, which perfectly matches your story. Since you also saw me, we are both cleared. \n\nNow, listen very closely to the routes the rest of you just claimed, because we have a guaranteed Duck. There is only ONE Duck in this game, which means we can use logic to find them.\n\nDiana, your story is completely impossible. You claimed you went Cafeteria -> Medbay -> Storage -> Lower Engine. And you explicitly stated you saw absolutely NO ONE. \n\nBut look at the other routes:\n1. Eve went Storage -> Medbay -> Cafeteria. That is the exact opposite of your path through the middle. You two would have crossed paths.\n2. Bob went Upper Engine -> Lower Engine -> Storage. That is the exact opposite of your path on the bottom left. You two also would have crossed paths.\n\nFor your story to be true, BOTH Eve and Bob would have to be lying about their routes. Since there is only one Duck, that's impossible. You faked your path, probably killed Frank in Medbay, and just threw out a random route without realizing it collided with two other people. \n\nI'm voting Diana, and everyone else should too.\n\nDiana"}}
