{"timestamp": 1779402696.058212, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Alice's logic is solid and I agree with the breakdown. My path was Storage \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Weapons, and Diana, if you really went Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Storage, we should have crossed in Medbay or at least seen each other in the corridor \u2014 but I saw nobody on that stretch. Same problem Alice pointed out: Bob went the opposite direction on the bottom and didn't see you either. Two independent routes contradicting yours is not a coincidence. Also, the timing fits \u2014 Frank was alive in Storage early (I saw him there at the start), then he headed up toward Medbay, which is exactly where your fake loop conveniently puts you right before the kill window. I'm locking in Diana."}}
