{"timestamp": 1779403118.90951, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Bob, I already told you \u2014 I saw Alice alive in lower engine at tick 15, and Charlie is the one who \"found\" her dead there. He's the last known person in that room with her. Charlie locked in his vote on me before I could even respond to his accusation, and so did you. That's exactly what a Duck and a panicked Goose look like when the Duck has set the narrative. I'm not changing my vote. Charlie killed Alice, and if you vote me, the Duck wins on the spot. Please, Bob \u2014 think about the room logic, not the social pressure. Vote Charlie with me. It's our only winning move."}}
